{'symbol': 'FISV', 'date': '2023-03-31 08:30:00', 'title': 'BANGOR SAVINGS BANK WINS 2023 CELENT MODEL BANK AWARD FOR INNOVATIVE INTEGRATION OF REWARDS AND PAYMENTS WITH FISERV', 'text': 'BROOKFIELD, WIS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BANGOR SAVINGS BANK, A SUBSIDIARY OF BANGOR BANCORP, MHC, HAS BEEN NAMED THE WINNER OF THE CELENT MODEL BANK 2023 AWARD FOR PAYMENTS INNOVATION.'}